g</span></a></li><li><a class="main_nav_active_item" href="4.html"><span class="main_nav_active_item_text">Careers</span></a></li><li><a class="main_nav_item" href="3.html"><span class="main_nav_item_text">News</span></a></li><li><a class="main_nav_item" href="5.html"><span class="main_nav_item_text">Contact Us</span></a></li></ul></div><div id="main_container"><div id="left_column_container"><div class="sub_nav_container"></div></div><div id="sub_container2"><div class="content" id="content_container"><p class="summary"><strong><font color="#0000ff">Careers</font></strong></p><p>Are you self motivated and driven to excel in your field? Do you enjoy working in team and do people enjoy working with you?&nbsp; If yes, then please email <a href="mailto:careers@streamt.com"><u><font color="#0066cc">careers@kpresources.com</font></u></a> to find out about career opportunities </p><p class="summary"><font color="#0000ff"><strong>Contractors</strong></font></p><p>Have you had enough of administering a proprietary company or dealing with management agents? Do you feel isolated as an individual contractor without the support of others in your field? Do you want to be part of a team of SAP&nbsp; specialists that can support each other as and when required?. If yes, then email <u><font color="#0066cc"><a href="mailto:careers@streamt.com"><u><font color="#0066cc">careers@kpresources.com</font></u></a></font></u> to find out how to become part of the KP Resources. </p></div></div></div><div id="footer"><div id="footer_text">KP RESOURCES LLC. Copyright 2008-2010.</div></div></div><div id="extra_div1"><span></span></div><div id="extra_div2"><span></span></div><div id="extra_div3"><span></span></div><div id="extra_div4"><span></span></div><div id="extra_div5"><span></span></div><div id="extra_div6"><span></span></div><div id="extra_div7"><span></span></div><div id="extra_div8"><span></span></div><div id="extra_div9"><span></span></div><div id="extra_div10"><span></span></div><div i